<title>USA: U S West Media Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>U S West Media Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.04		    $0.07</p>
<p> Oper net		   18,000		   33,000</p>
<p> Revs			694,000		  604,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  473,900		  471,200</p>
<p>			Nine Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.01		    $0.15</p>
<p> Oper net		   10,000		   73,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,965,000		1,725,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  473,500		  470,100</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus Q3 estimate was $0.02/shr loss.</p>
<p>1995 operating net in both periods excludes loss of $4 million, or $0.01/shr, on early debt repayment.</p>
<p>Net includes pretax equity losses in unconsolidated ventures of $81 million vs $38 million in quarter and $224 million vs $128 million in nine months.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
